Manage Division Chief's calendar, appointments, meetings, conferences, and travel, optimizing time and resources;
Prepare agendas, record meeting minutes, and track action items;
Maintain accurate filing systems (electronic & physical) for easy information retrieval and policy compliance;
Manage and prioritize incoming/outgoing correspondence (mail, email, faxes);
Answer calls, screen visitors, and provide professional assistance to stakeholders;
Maintain office supplies and equipment, anticipating needs and coordinating repairs
Prepare and process purchase requisitions, invoices, and expense reports accurately and in compliance with policies;
Assist in preparing, editing, and distributing communication materials (newsletters, press releases, website content, social media, presentations)
